style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We now have a public hash =
equivalence service from the autobuilder available and instructions on =
testing with this are on the mailing list. With a couple of recent =
fixes, build from the autobuilder sstate are now possible and quite =
effective.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Issues have been found in the =
