pending in master-next.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have noticed bitbake was =
hiding deprecation warnings and plan to fix that before the&nbsp; =
release of 3.4. This may cause some warnings to become visible before =
release that will need fixing but some of those issues will be =
problematic with python 3.10 which will be released in the lifetime of =
3.4.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Fixes for task failure handling =
